		},
		{
			"character": "character-1649630816.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "Esto es un problema que podría extenderse a otras ciudades. Es lo que los Ahuizotes quieren."
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1649630816.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "La Orden tiene protocolos para combatir esta enfermedad."
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1710263881.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "Oh, ¿de verdad está dispuesta a ayudarnos?"
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1649630816.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "..."
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1649630816.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "Angry",
			"text": "Señora, no crea en las mentiras de los Ahuizotes. Se aprovechan de la necesidad de las personas."
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1649630816.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "Angry",
			"text": "john Trithemius es un lobo disfrazado de oveja."
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1649630816.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "Angry",
			"text": "Se deshace de aquellos que no le son de utilidad, como si fueran basura."
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1710263881.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "..."
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1710263881.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "Aunque tu rostro muestre una ciega ira, tu voz suena con tan sutil tristeza..."
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1649630816.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "Angry",
			"text": "..."
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1649630816.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "Meh",
			"text": "Ah... como sea."
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1649630816.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "Default",
			"text": "Si de verdad quiere cambiar las cosas, deje de creer en las patrañas de los Ahuizotes."
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1710263881.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "Gracias señorita nabig."
		},
		{
			"animation": "[Default]",
			"animation_length": 0,
			"change_mirror_portrait": false,
			"change_z_index": false,
			"character": "character-1710263881.json",
